Game ..> Position : uses
Game ..> Piece : uses
ChessGUI ..> Board : uses
ChessGUI ..> Position : uses
ChessGUI ..> Piece : uses
ChessGUI ..> AIPlayer : uses
ChessGUI ..> ChessClient : uses
ChessBoardPanel ..> Board : uses
ChessBoardPanel ..> Position : uses
ChessBoardPanel ..> Piece : uses
MoveRecord ..> Position : uses
MoveRecord ..> Piece : uses
GameState ..> Board : uses
GameState ..> MoveRecord : uses
